  "all_ingredients_flat": "Whole Wheat Pita Bread, Broccoli microgreens, Red bell peppers, Cucumbers, Chickpeas, Turmeric red chili powder, Cumin seed powder, Lemon juice, Mint leaves, Garlic powder, White vinegar, Lime juice, Plant-based yogurt, Water, Ground black pepper, Salt",
  "instructions": "Warm Whole Wheat Pita Bread & slice into halves. Stuff them with all the ingredients listed below. Add tzatziki sauce in the end as topping.\nIngredients: (a) Broccoli microgreens. (b) Diced red bell peppers & cucumbers. (c) Air fried chickpeas coated with spices like turmeric red chili powder, cumin seed powder & some lemon juice\nTZATZIKI SAUCE:\nWhisk plant-based yogurt & water into smooth consistency. Add spices & mix well. Add thinly diced cucumbers, chopped mint, lemon juice & a pinch of salt.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "warm",
